      {
        "id": "textbook-what-is-comprehension",
        "moduleId": "new-list-problem",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "教材定义：从现有列表得到新列表",
        "markdown": "列表推导（List Comprehension）用于从一份现有的列表中得到一份新列表，而不是在原列表上就地修改。\n\n教材给出的典型情境是：已经有一份数字列表，希望得到一份对应列表，其中大于 2 的数字乘以 2。列表推导正是这类“筛选并变换”需求的合适写法。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-02a2660bfbda114ce9f016b3",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000142"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "更多",
                "列表推导"
              ],
              "lineStart": 1218,
              "lineEnd": 1224,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "f9e2d49bd8fab74f9405c5e2808bfadf67d7634295b677405027630b6f15058f"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-loop-equivalence",
        "moduleId": "new-list-problem",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "模型补充：与循环写法的对应",
        "markdown": "教材把列表推导与循环收集的写法对应起来。下面两种写法都从 `numbers = [1, 2, 3, 4]` 生成新列表：\n\n```python\nresult = []\nfor i in numbers:\n    if i > 2:\n        result.append(2 * i)\n```\n\n```python\nresult = [2 * i for i in numbers if i > 2]\n```\n\n列表推导把“遍历、筛选、计算、追加”四步压缩成一行，减少了样板代码。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-what-is-comprehension"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-syntax-order",
        "moduleId": "syntax-and-execution",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "模型补充：一般形式与求值顺序",
        "markdown": "列表推导的一般形状可以写成：`[表达式 for 变量 in 可迭代对象 if 条件]`。\n\n执行时逐个从可迭代对象中取出元素，先检查 `if` 条件；条件为真时再计算 `表达式`，并把结果按顺序放入新列表；条件为假则跳过该元素。`if` 条件可以省略，此时每个元素都会被处理。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-what-is-comprehension",
            "model-loop-equivalence"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-example-rule",
        "moduleId": "worked-example",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "example",
        "title": "教材示例：条件与操作",
        "markdown": "教材在示例中说明：当满足条件 `if i > 2` 时，执行指定操作 `2 * i`，以此获得一份新的列表；原始列表依旧保持不变。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-02a2660bfbda114ce9f016b3",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000142"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
