              ],
              "lineStart": 1218,
              "lineEnd": 1224,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "f9e2d49bd8fab74f9405c5e2808bfadf67d7634295b677405027630b6f15058f"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-element-trace",
        "moduleId": "worked-example",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "worked-example",
        "title": "模型补充：逐元素追踪",
        "markdown": "以 `numbers = [1, 2, 3, 4]` 为例逐元素检查：\n\n| 当前元素 | 是否满足 `i > 2` | 是否加入结果 | 结果列表 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | 否 | 跳过 | `[]` |\n| 2 | 否 | 跳过 | `[]` |\n| 3 | 是 | 加入 `2 * 3 = 6` | `[6]` |\n| 4 | 是 | 加入 `2 * 4 = 8` | `[6, 8]` |\n\n处理结束后新列表为 `[6, 8]`，而 `numbers` 仍是 `[1, 2, 3, 4]`。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-example-rule",
            "model-syntax-order"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-boilerplate-advantage",
        "moduleId": "when-to-use",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "教材指出的优点",
        "markdown": "教材指出，使用列表推导的优点在于：当我们需要用循环处理列表中的每个元素并把结果存储到新列表中时，列表推导能减少样板（Boilerplate）代码的数量。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
